# ZPause T6 settings -- generated by tools/mk_t8_settings.py.
# name|type|default|section|description
zp_only_script|int|0|debug|Debug. With both the loose script and the mod-folder copy installed, run only the loose one.
zp_only_mod|int|0|debug|Debug. The same, the other way round. Both off — the default — is whichever loads first. Both on leaves nothing running. Read when the script loads, so end the game and start a new one for a change to take.
zp_host_only|int|0|debug|Only the host can pause or resume. Everyone else's chat command and combo are ignored, and a pause never goes to a vote. On a dedicated server there is no host, so it falls to whoever holds the first player slot.
zp_allow_short_words|int|0|debug|Also accept bare p / u / pause in chat. Off by default so normal conversation can't pause the game.
zp_button_combo|int|1|debug|Enable the button combos.
zp_combo|str|crouch_melee|debug|Which combo pauses: crouch_melee, crouch_use, crouch_frag, crouch_ads, jump_melee, use_frag, frag_only, use_ads, use_attack, attack_ads.
zp_button_hold_time|float|0.3|debug|How long the combo must be held.
zp_button_combo_dead|str|use_ads|debug|Combo used while downed or spectating, when stance and melee stop registering. Also takes use_attack, attack_ads, use_frag, frag_only. "" = chat only.
zp_vote_no_combo_dead|str|use_attack|debug|The same, for a no vote.
zp_input_debug|int|0|debug|Print each player which buttons the server receives from them, for picking the two above.
zp_ready_check|int|0|voting|Resuming waits for the players to say they're back. Not a vote — nobody says no and it can't fail, so it needs no zp_vote, and it wins over zp_vote_unpause where both are set.
zp_ready_percent|int|100|voting|How much of the room has to be ready. 100 is everybody.
zp_host_approve|int|0|voting|The host pauses at once; anyone else has to ask and the host answers yes or no. It runs as a vote only the host can cast, so the yes/no input, the HUD and the timeout are a vote's. Pausing only — resuming still follows zp_vote. zp_host_only wins where both are set.
zp_vote|int|0|voting|Put pauses to a vote. See [Voting](#voting).
zp_vote_min|int|2|voting|Minimum yes votes, whatever the player count.
zp_vote_percent|int|51|voting|Percent of players who must vote yes.
zp_vote_time|float|30|voting|Seconds a vote stays open.
zp_vote_unpause|int|0|voting|Resuming needs a vote too.
zp_vote_hold|int|0|voting|Freeze the game while the vote runs, and resume it if the vote fails.
zp_vote_initiator_yes|int|1|voting|Whoever called the vote counts as a yes.
zp_vote_lockout|float|10|voting|Seconds before another vote can be called after one fails.
zp_vote_hud|int|1|voting|Show the vote tally on screen.
zp_vote_show_voters|int|1|voting|List each player and how they voted.
zp_vote_hud_position|str|top|voting|Where the vote tally sits. See [Where the HUD sits](#where-the-hud-sits).
zp_vote_alive_only|int|1|voting|Leave bled-out spectators out of the threshold and the count.
zp_vote_result_time|float|2|voting|Seconds the result stands on the tally after a vote resolves. 0 = clear at once.
zp_vote_no_combo|str|jump_melee|voting|Combo for a no vote: jump_melee, crouch_use, crouch_frag, crouch_ads, crouch_melee.
zp_round_pause|int|0|timing|Hold a pause until the round is over instead of freezing the game mid-horde. Asking again calls it off.
zp_max_pauses|int|0|timing|How many times one match can be paused. 0 is no cap. Only a pause somebody asked for spends one — an automatic pause does not.
zp_pause_on_disconnect|int|0|timing|Pause when somebody drops, so whoever is left isn't overrun while they rejoin. Nothing un-pauses on its own, so zp_max_pause_time is the way out if they don't come back.
zp_countdown|int|3|timing|Seconds of 3‑2‑1 before play resumes.
zp_ease|int|1|timing|Ease time down into the pause and back out, instead of cutting to a stop.
zp_ease_time|float|0.35|timing|Seconds of ramp at each end.
zp_grace|float|2|timing|Seconds of invulnerability after resuming.
zp_cooldown|float|2|timing|Minimum seconds between toggles.
zp_max_pause_time|int|0|timing|Auto-resume after N seconds. 0 = unlimited.
zp_engine_freeze|int|1|what gets frozen|Use disablezombies() / enablezombies().
zp_drift_guard|int|1|what gets frozen|Snap back any AI that still manages to move.
zp_freeze_anims|int|1|what gets frozen|Put zombies in a standing idle pose instead of looping their last animation.
zp_silence_zombies|int|1|what gets frozen|Stop zombies growling while paused.
zp_godmode|int|1|what gets frozen|Make players invulnerable while paused.
zp_control_guard|int|1|what gets frozen|Re-apply the player freeze every tick, so a map script can't hand controls back mid-pause.
zp_freeze_clock|int|1|what gets frozen|Hold the match timer.
zp_freeze_powerups|int|1|what gets frozen|Stop ground powerups timing out.
zp_freeze_effects|int|1|what gets frozen|Hold insta-kill / double-points countdowns.
zp_freeze_bleedout|int|1|what gets frozen|Stop downed players bleeding out.
zp_hud|int|1|presentation|Draw the pause block at all. The vote HUD is separate and still draws.
zp_blackout|int|1|presentation|Dim everyone's screen while paused, which keeps the pause text readable over a bright skybox. Raise zp_blackout_alpha for the anti-scouting blackout this used to be.
zp_blackout_alpha|float|0.2|presentation|How far it dims. 0.2 is a light darkening; 1 is fully black.
zp_show_hint|int|1|presentation|Tell players how to pause when they spawn.
zp_hud_position|str|center|presentation|Where the pause banner sits. See [Where the HUD sits](#where-the-hud-sits).
zp_hud_binds|int|1|presentation|Draw combos as each player's bound buttons instead of words.
zp_hud_glow|int|1|presentation|Black glow behind the HUD text, to carry it over a bright skybox.
zp_hud_panel|int|0|presentation|Black slab behind the whole block. Heavier than the glow.
zp_hud_panel_alpha|float|0.45|presentation|How opaque that slab is. 1 is solid black.
zp_hud_panel_width|int|340|presentation|How wide it is, in HUD units.
zp_hud_timer|int|1|presentation|Show who paused and how long it's been under the banner.
zp_blur|int|1|presentation|Blur everyone's screen while paused. Clears when play resumes.
zp_blur_amount|float|2|presentation|Blur strength. 4 is the blur the game runs when you buy a perk.
zp_pause_sound|str|zmb_zombie_go_inert|presentation|Played when the game is paused. "" = silent.
zp_countdown_sound|str|zmb_tombstone_timer_count|presentation|Played on each countdown tick. "" = silent.
zp_resume_sound|str|zmb_zombie_end_inert|presentation|Played when play resumes. "" = silent.
